@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans JP
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam sequence {
    ActorFontSize 18
    ActorFontStyle bold
    ParticipantFontSize 16
    NoteFontSize 14
    MessageFontSize 14
    BoxPadding 6
    ParticipantPadding 12
}
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam titleFontSize 20

title フレンドチャット

autonumber

actor "ユーザー" as User
participant "アプリ" as App
participant "Friends"
participant "中継Server" as WSServer
participant "相手" as Peer

== 接続 ==
User -> App: チャットを開く
App -> Friends: openChat(roomId)
Friends -> WSServer: WebSocket接続
WSServer --> Friends: 接続確立

== 送信 ==
User -> App: メッセージ送信
App -> Friends: sendChatMessage()
Friends -> Friends: 楽観的UI表示
Friends -> WSServer: message(text)
WSServer -> Peer: 中継
WSServer --> Friends: 送信確認

== 受信 ==
Peer -> WSServer: 返信
WSServer -> Friends: 受信
Friends --> App: 吹き出し表示

== 切断 ==
User -> App: 閉じる
Friends -> WSServer: 切断

@enduml
